&lt;li&gt;You will collaborate cross functionally to mitigate churn and to identify expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep knowledge of customers’ organizational dynamics and the role of direct mail in achieving business objectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
